# @ui-morph/react

- Paths and overrides are **DOM-based** (`tree/domDecorator.ts`), not React element tree walking.
- Use `data-morph-path` on elements; stable IDs via `data-morph-id`. Skip subtrees with `data-morph-passthrough`.
- Editor chrome must use `data-morph-editor` so MutationObserver and click suppression ignore it.
- Styles: `.morph-editor-*` namespace in `editor/editorStyles.ts`; avoid heavy UI dependencies.
- Config changes go through `configReducer` + `ConfigContext`; persist via `StorageAdapter` only.
- `Morph` resolves `viewId` from prop or `window.location.pathname` when omitted.
- Build: `tsc -b && vite build` (ESM + CJS). `react` / `react-dom` are peer dependencies.
